    "en": {
      "쉘 타입 니들 롤러 베어링 (인치계열) | ILJIN 베어링": "Shell Type Needle Roller Bearings (Inch Series) | ILJIN Bearing",
      "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Shell Type Needle Roller Bearings (Inch Series)</p> <h2>쉘 타입 니들 롤러 베어링 (인치계열)</h2> <p>얇고 열처리된 강판재 컵모양 외륜에 니들 롤러 결합체를 조립한 인치 규격 베어링입니다.</p> <p>BA(개방형)와 BHA(폐쇄형) 두 형태로 공급되며, 북미·유럽 규격 장비의 보수 부품으로 주로 사용됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>": "<p class=\"eyebrow\">Shell Type Needle Roller Bearings (Inch Series)</p> <h2>Shell Type Needle Roller Bearings (Inch Series)</h2> <p>An inch-spec bearing assembled with a needle roller assembly in a thin, heat-treated steel-plate cup-shaped outer ring.</p> <p>Supplied in two types, BA (open type) and BHA (closed type), and mainly used as maintenance parts for North American/European spec equipment.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just the model number or part of the dimensions.</p>",
      "<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/shell_needle_inch.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · B(폭)</p>": "<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS catalog specification drawing</p> <img src=\"img/shell_needle_inch.png\" alt=\"Structural cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(bore) · D(outer diameter) · Tolerance (d/D) · B(width)</p>",
